      <td valign=top style='padding:0in 0in 0in 0in'>
      <p><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Liquid Levels </b>is back and improved.
      We want to offer everyone a fair and trustworthy service at a cheaper
      rate then anyone <span class=SpellE>else.What</span> we offer as a power
      leveling service is</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Levels 1-65</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Alternate Advanced points</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Flagging (May vary upon request)</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Skills (defense, spell <span class=SpellE>casting,etc</span>)</p>
      <p><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>How does this work?<o:p></o:p></b></p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Available only on <span class=SpellE>Stormhammer</span>.
      If you are not currently on this premium server it is very simple to
      transfer your character (all items will stay intact for a subscription
      fee <span class=GramE>of <span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>39.99</span>).
      Just email us if you have any questions and we can help you through the
      process!</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>We power level 16-20 hours a day and guarantee
      “<span class=SpellE>atleast</span>” 10aa’s per day.</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Account info is not required but
      recommended</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Email us after you have used “buy it
      now”</p>
      <p style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3;
      tab-stops:list .5in'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-family:Symbol;
      mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol'><span
      style='mso-list:Ignore'>·<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
      </span></span></span><![endif]>Receive daily updates on your characters
      progression</p>
      <p><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>About Us?<o:p></o:p></b></p>
      <p style='text-align:justify;line-height:11.25pt'><span
      class=purplebold1><span style='font-size:9.0pt'>Liquid Levels</span></span><span
      style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Arial'> is currently a power leveling
      service that is based on <span class=SpellE>Stormhammer</span>. We do all
      levels, alternate advancement, flagging (<span class=SpellE>GoD</span> / <span
      class=SpellE>Pov</span> / <span class=SpellE>PoS</span>), and Epics. You
      can take advantage of my services by being transferred permanently or
      temporarily. If you do decide to transfer temporarily I recommend that
      you maximize your stay and use my discounted prices that I currently
      offer at that time (applies to return customers). You won't have to pay
      for the transfer <span class=GramE>itself,</span> instead you will have
      to pay a subscription fee of 39.99 a month. This transfer includes all
      items and anything that is on your character and allows you to move back
      to your original server whenever you want, free of charge.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
      <p style='text-align:justify;line-height:11.25pt'><span style='font-size:
      9.0pt;font-family:Arial'>I started out as a part time power leveling
      service and now this is what I do for a living. Up to date I have leveled
      for over 100+ unique customers and have done thousands of AA points and
      hundreds of levels. I am dedicated to the <span class=SpellE>upmost</span>
      customer service and will continue to strive to offer the best service at
      an affordable price. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
